Location: src/registry/liveness.rs:89-93
Context: primary fix: resume must not clear the miss streak
```
// Before:
        for addr in &due {
            self.reported.remove(addr);
            self.missed.remove(addr);
            self.streak_start_epoch.remove(addr);
        }
// After:
