### 🔵 Move migration door verifies entries against a caller-supplied state root, so fabricated Aptos modules and resources are imported as proven source state

**Severity:** LOW

**TL;DR:** `apply_move_migration` in `src/execution/coordinator/migration/non_evm.rs` folds every entry against `req.state_root`, a root that arrives inside the same request, so the "proof" only shows self-consistency.

**Impact:** A holder of an Aptos keypair can import arbitrary Move modules and resource payloads into its own Move account, recorded as verified source-chain state, paying a fee priced from the proof depth it claims.

**Root cause:**
